WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:05,230
Daqing, stop talking, that thing is full of poison

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:07,030
Qing Dynasty, come back

3
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,630
Damn it, the gun doesn't even work anymore

4
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,080
If the gun doesn't work, then change it to something it's afraid of

5
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,300
Everyone, step back and give Changsheng a place to feel pain.

6
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:23,630
That's it

7
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:33,060
Go back and suppress it

8
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,170
Okay, I can’t make it through

9
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,760
Don't move, keep a safe distance, and wait for the airflow to disperse.
